<h3><u>Jab bhi ho karbobala aap ka jana bhaiyya</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Haye..<br />
Akhri baar mera haal e musibat sunlo<br />
bhai sajjad ye sakina ki wasiyat sunlo<br />
jab bhi karbobala aapka jana bhaiyya..(2)<br />
meri rudaad chacha jaa&#39;n ko sunana bhaiyya</p>

<p>Ye wasiyat meri..<br />
ye wasiyat meri tum bhul na jaana bhaiyya<br />
meri rudaad chacha jaa&#39;n ko sunana bhaiyya<br />
jab bhi karbobala aapka jana bhaiyya..(2)</p>

<p>1. Wo agar puche mera haal chacha se kehna<br />
meri neendein hui pamaal chacha se kehna<br />
taziyano ka sab ehwaal chacha se kehna<br />
ab bhi neele hai mere gaal chacha se kehna<br />
jo sitam mujh pa hue saare batana bhaiyya<br />
meri rudaad chacha jaa&#39;n ko sunana bhaiyya</p>

<p>2. Paao jalte the mere hoti thi eeza mujhko<br />
chhao me baithne dete na the adaa mujhko<br />
jab bhi chalte hue ghash dhoop mein aaya mujhko<br />
oonth ki pusht se jallad ne bandha mujhko<br />
mai bohot royi..<br />
mai bohot royi magar shimr na maana bhaiyya<br />
meri rudaad chacha jaa&#39;n ko sunana bhaiyya</p>

<p>3. Jab haram qaid hue maine chacha ko dhundha<br />
jab bandhe 12 gale maine chacha ko dhundha<br />
jab gohar mere chine maine chacha ko dhundha<br />
jab mujhe durre lage maine chacha ko dhundha<br />
wo agar hote satata na zamana bhaiyya<br />
meri rudaad chacha jaa&#39;n ko sunana bhaiyya</p>

<p>4. Qaid khane se hi mansoob hai ab zaat meri<br />
hoga ehsaan nibha doge agar baat meri<br />
chayn se qabr mein ghat jayegi har raat meri<br />
jiteji un se na ho payi mulaqat meri<br />
sar chacha jaa&#39;n ka...<br />
sar chacha jaa&#39;n ka meri qabr pe laana bhaiyya<br />
meri rudaad chacha jaa&#39;n ko sunana bhaiyya</p>

<p>5. Karbala jao to aisa nahi hone dena<br />
unko tanhai ka sadma nahi hone dena<br />
mere ammu ko akela nahi hone dena<br />
qabr e ghazi pe andhera nahi hone dena<br />
ek diya meri taraf se bhi jalana bhaiyya<br />
meri rudaad chacha jaa&#39;n ko sunana bhaiyya</p>

<p>6. Mere ehsaas e gharibi se bachana unko<br />
yaad wo waqt e musibat na dilana unko<br />
mera ehwal e kanizi na sunana unko<br />
hashmi sher hai mat yaad dilana unko<br />
mai nahi chahti....<br />
mai nahi chahti phir hashr uthana bhaiyya<br />
jab bhi ho...</p>

<p>7. Qaid se chootke jab karbobala jaoge<br />
pehle to karna salam unko meri janib se<br />
phir batana ke ye din kaise guzare maine<br />
aur jab phool chadhane lago us turbat pe<br />
meri janib se rida meri udhana bhaiyya<br />
meri rudaad chacha jaa&#39;n ko sunana bhaiyya</p>

<p>8. Sunke arif ye wasiyat thi qayamat barpa<br />
laashe abbas tadapti thi sare karbobala<br />
aur sajjad ki ankho se lahu jari tha<br />
jis ghadi bali sakina ne ye ahista kaha<br />
meri mayyat ko andhere mein uthana bhaiyya..(2)<br />
bhaiyya bhaiyya bhaiyya..(2)</p>
</p>
